# 🏋️ Gym Analytics Data Pipeline using AWS

An end-to-end cloud-based Data Engineering project that processes gym performance and diet data using AWS services to generate actionable business insights through interactive dashboards.

---

## 🚀 Overview

Gym management systems collect large amounts of workout and nutrition data but often fail to extract meaningful insights. This project builds a scalable AWS-based analytics pipeline that automates data ingestion, transformation, storage, and visualization.

The pipeline leverages AWS services including Amazon S3, AWS Glue, Amazon Athena, Amazon Redshift, and Amazon QuickSight to transform raw CSV datasets into analytics-ready data.

---

## ✨ Features

- Automated ETL pipeline using AWS Glue (PySpark)
- Cloud-based data lake using Amazon S3
- Serverless SQL analytics with Amazon Athena
- Data warehouse using Amazon Redshift
- Interactive dashboards using Amazon QuickSight
- BMI calculation and categorization
- Weekly workout & nutrition analytics
- Trainer performance analysis
- Membership retention analysis

---

## 🛠 Tech Stack

- Python
- PySpark
