---

## 📊 AWS Architecture

```
Raw CSV Files
        │
        ▼
Amazon S3
        │
        ▼
AWS Glue ETL (PySpark)
        │
        ▼
AWS Glue Data Catalog
    │            │
    ▼            ▼
Amazon Athena  Amazon Redshift
       │         │
       └────┬────┘
            ▼
Amazon QuickSight
            │
            ▼
Interactive Dashboards
```

---

## 📂 Dataset

The project processes multiple datasets including:

- Members
- Workout Logs
- Diet Logs
- Trainer Details

Key attributes include

- Height
- Weight
- BMI
- Workout Duration
- Calories Burned
- Calories Intake
- Protein Intake
- Workout Intensity
- Membership Type

---

## ⚙️ ETL Pipeline

The AWS Glue PySpark job performs:

- Data Cleaning
- Null Value Removal
- Duplicate Removal
- Date Standardization
- BMI Calculation
- Workout Intensity Encoding
- Weekly Aggregations
- Data Export in Parquet Format

---

## 📈 Dashboard Insights

The dashboard provides

- BMI Distribution
- Workout Effectiveness
- Diet vs Workout Analysis
- Trainer Performance Leaderboard
- Peak Gym Traffic
- Membership Retention
- Weekly Nutrition Trends

